1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,950
Once upon a time, there was a small boy named James Henry Trotter.

2
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:12,400
After losing his parents, James was sent to live with his two aunts, Spiker and Sponge...

3
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:15,290
and they were TERRIBLE.

4
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:20,080
They made him work all day and never let him play.

5
00:00:21,370 --> 00:00:28,220
Then one afternoon, a strange old man handed James a little bag of glowing green things.

6
00:00:28,910 --> 00:00:30,770
"Magic," he said.

7
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,910
But James tripped!

8
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:37,180
The magic spilled into the ground beneath an old peach tree...

9
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,940
and something began to grow.

10
00:00:40,610 --> 00:00:41,940
A peach!

11
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:45,650
It grew bigger... and BIGGER...

12
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:48,300
until it was as large as a house!

13
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:53,230
That night, James crawled through a hole in its side

14
00:00:53,610 --> 00:00:55,530
and found... giant bugs!

15
00:00:56,410 --> 00:00:58,070
A wise Grasshopper,

16
00:00:58,120 --> 00:00:59,830
a kind Ladybird,

17
00:00:59,910 --> 00:01:01,490
a gentle Spider,

18
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:03,380
a worried Earthworm,

19
00:01:03,550 --> 00:01:06,050
and a very boastful Centipede.

20
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:09,340
The Centipede chewed through the stem,

21
00:01:09,390 --> 00:01:11,910
and the peach went ROLLING down the hill,

22
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:13,740
right over the mean aunts...

23
00:01:13,790 --> 00:01:15,720
and far out to sea.

24
00:01:16,660 --> 00:01:19,340
But sharks began circling the peach!

25
00:01:19,670 --> 00:01:21,390
So James had an idea.

26
00:01:21,860 --> 00:01:25,650
His friends tied silk threads to hundreds of seagulls,

27
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:29,430
and slowly... the peach lifted into the sky.

28
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:32,180
They floated over the ocean,

29
00:01:32,290 --> 00:01:35,970
past strange cloud people who painted rainbows...

30
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:38,300
all the way to New York City.

31
00:01:39,220 --> 00:01:42,970
The peach landed right on top of the Empire State Building!

32
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:48,050
The children of the city ate the peach, every last bite.

33
00:01:48,790 --> 00:01:49,880
And James?

34
00:01:50,450 --> 00:01:53,170
He lived in the giant peach stone in the park...

35
00:01:53,220 --> 00:01:56,340
surrounded by friends, happy at last.

36
00:01:57,250 --> 00:01:59,900
The end.
